      "value": "[The Great Pug](https://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_6caf5200-70e1-46c2-b043-e3c4abe69e0f/info) world (`wrld_6caf5200-70e1-46c2-b043-e3c4abe69e0f`) hosted by Pug Dwellers group was affected by this since 2026-10-13, no known cause. I've suggested Marlon to submit a crash dump too.\n\nThe crashes I experienced in The Great Pug fit the description of the above, while analyzing the output logs from my computer. The client crash happens while loading into the world before seeing the world, with logs indicating several avatar animators being loaded at once. It didn't seem to be any specific avatar that caused it with any consistency, and it wasn't anything like an EasyAntiCheat closing the client on an audio codec library or similar.",
